\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump} \\vdash A&#39;\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump} \\vdash A&#39;\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Turing跳跃：相对停机问题</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\">\\(A&#39;\\)</span>：相对于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>的停机集</li>\n<li>比<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>更&quot;不可解&quot;</li>\n<li>对上述可接受编号，跳跃定理给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&lt;_T A&#39;\">\\(A&lt;_T A&#39;\\)</span>（严格更强）；这不是定义式本身的同义改写</li>\n<li>可迭代：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;&#39;\">\\(A&#39;&#39;\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;&#39;&#39;\">\\(A&#39;&#39;&#39;\\)</span>, ...</li>\n<li>与不完备性层级对应</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset&#39;\\equiv_T K\">\\(\\emptyset&#39;\\equiv_T K\\)</span>；只有在无预言机编号与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>所用编号相互配准时才可写成字面相等</li>\n<li>Turing层级与算术层级相关</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-halting-problem","status":"resolved","id":"127af5e2492cd2af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-problem","status":"resolved","id":"127af5e2492cd2af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\Phi_e^A)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ (fixed acceptable enumeration of the unary partial $A$-oracle-computable functions, relative version 